{"v":1,"id":"un-robot-a-la-maison","titre":"A Robot at Home","titreFr":"Un robot à la maison","auteur":"HaqqReason","niveau":"A1","genre":"Science-fiction","resume":"Un samedi matin, une grande boîte arrive chez Hugo, neuf ans. Dedans, il y a Bip, un petit robot bleu qui veut aider toute la famille… mais qui met les chaussettes au frigo et arrose le chat ! Hugo décide de lui apprendre les règles. Le dimanche, pour l'anniversaire de grand-père, Bip et Hugo auront bien besoin de s'entraider.","mots":1329,"gloses":[["Hugo (prénom)","Hugo","np"],["est","be","v","être"],["neuf","nine","a"],["ans (nine years old : a neuf ans)","year","n","an"],["(nine years old : a neuf ans)","old","a"],["il, elle ; le, la ; cela","it","p"],["samedi","Saturday","np"],["matin","morning","n"],["dans, en, à","in","r"],["le, la, les","the","t"],["cuisine","kitchen","n"],["avec","with","r"],["maman","mum","n"],["et","and","c"],["papa","dad","n"],["a","have","v","avoir"],["un, une","a","t"],["tasse","cup","n"],["de","of","r"],["thé","tea","n"],["fait","make","v","faire"],["toasts","toast","n"],["mange","eat","v","manger"],["son, sa, ses ; le sien","his","p"],["céréales","cereal","n"],["sonnette","doorbell","n"],["sonne","ring","v","sonner"],["homme","man","n"],["apporte","bring","v","apporter"],["grande","big","a"],["boîte","box","n"],["très","very","d"],["plus haute","tall","a","grand"],["que","than","r"],["ce, cette ; ceci","this","t"],["pour ; pendant","for","r"],["tu, vous ; te, toi","you","p"],["il","he","p"],["dit","say","v","dire"],["merci (thank you)","thank","v","remercier"],["(thank you : merci)","you","p"],["elle","she","p"],["lit","read","v","lire"],["étiquette","label","n"],["cadeau","present","n"],["de, depuis","from","r"],["tante","aunt","n"],["Nadia (prénom)","Nadia","np"],["que, quoi ; ce que","what","p"],["demande","ask","v","demander"],["ouvre","open","v","ouvrir"],["deux","two","a"],["bleues","blue","a"],["lumières","light","n","lumière"],["brillent","shine","v","briller"],[